# AWS Security Group Provisioning with Terraform

This project automates the creation of an AWS Security Group using Terraform variables on the Nautilus infrastructure.

## Project Structure

- `main.tf`: Contains the primary resource definition for the AWS Security Group, referencing input variables.
- `variables.tf`: Defines input variables, including `KKE_sg` which sets the security group name to `xfusion-sg`.
- `provider.tf`: Configures the required AWS provider.

## Execution

1. Initialize Terraform:
   ```bash
   terraform init
Apply the configuration:

Bash
terraform apply -auto-approve

